  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disease Surveillance Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this new agreement is to strengthen disease surveillance and emergency or outbreak prevention, detection, and response activities, while concurrently initiating or sustaining relevant health system programming, as they relate to population mobility, transportation networks and corridors, border health, migrant populations, and regional/cross-border coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
